{"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings"],"anchor":"Related-Documentation","title":"Related Documentation"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag"],"anchor":"Patterns","title":"Patterns","generated":true}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"Interaction — Pinch","modules":[{"name":"Swami"}],"role":"sampleCode","roleHeading":"Sample Code"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Pinch"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Preview","level":2,"anchor":"Preview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]},{"type":"heading","text":"The patch","level":2,"anchor":"The-patch"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Origami drives this with an ","type":"text"},{"code":"origami.PopSwitch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — a remembered on\/off state — flipped by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a pinch and fed into a Transform Scale. There’s no helper to reach for: it maps straight","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"onto native SwiftUI, which is the reusable idea worth taking away. A ","type":"text"},{"code":"MagnifyGesture","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reads the pinch, a ","type":"text"},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" flag flips at a threshold, and a ","type":"text"},{"code":".spring","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" animates the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scale between the two states (see the State\/memory → ","type":"text"},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" row in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@State private var popped = false","","RoundedTriangle(cornerRadius: 20)","    .frame(width: 90, height: 80)","    .scaleEffect(popped ? 2 : 1)","    .animation(.spring(response: 0.35, dampingFraction: 0.7), value: popped)","    .gesture(","        MagnifyGesture().onEnded { value in","            if value.magnification > 1.25 { popped = true }","            else if value.magnification < 0.8 { popped = false }","        }","    )"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The pop is the point: a discrete state the gesture toggles, animated with a spring — not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a scale that tracks your fingers continuously.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"How it’s built","level":2,"anchor":"How-its-built"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The full view sits the white rounded triangle on the magenta artboard and adds a live","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@GestureState"},{"text":" so the shape follows your fingers mid-pinch before it settles on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"popped state. Read the source (below) for the whole thing.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Behavior","level":2,"anchor":"Behavior"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pinch out on the shape to grow it; pinch in to shrink it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Cross the threshold and it snaps to the next size with a spring, rather than","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracking your fingers continuously.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The switch remembers its state, so a release between pinches holds the current size."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Downloads","level":2,"anchor":"Downloads"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift sample"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/swamikit\/swami\/blob\/development\/app\/Swami\/Patterns\/Interaction_Pinch.swift","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — the full source. Read it to see how the pop maps to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"type":"text","text":" + a spring; paste it to run it."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Origami source","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/origami.design\/public\/origami_files\/patterns\/Interaction_Pinch.origami"},{"type":"text","text":" — the original prototype (opens in Origami Studio)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinch"]}],"sampleCodeDownload":{"kind":"sampleDownload","action":{"overridingTitle":"Open in Origami","type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/origami.design\/public\/origami_files\/patterns\/Interaction_Pinch.origami","isActive":true}},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch a shape to scale it. Past a threshold it pops to an enlarged size with a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spring; pinch back in and it pops home."}],"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/OrigamiMappings":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/origamimappings","kind":"article","role":"article","type":"topic","title":"Origami → SwiftUI reference","abstract":[{"text":"What each Origami patch becomes in SwiftUI, so you know which construct — or which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","isActive":true},{"text":" helper — to reach for.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Sw